=== RETRACTION (appended after audit) ===
The four "*** W=N CONTRA SIGNAL ***" lines above are FALSE ALARMS produced by a
bug in the watcher that wrote them.  The alarm regex was  contra[^0]  , and the
character following "contra" in the eliminator's stats line is an apostrophe,
not a digit -- so it matched  'contra': 0  and fired on EVERY run regardless of
the data.  The underlying stats for all four levels read  'contra': 0,
'open_leaves': 1  : NO contradiction was found at any level, and every level
finished with one unresolved open leaf.
Regex corrected to  'contra': [1-9]  .  Recorded results (trustworthy):
  W=13  187.5s  r2=41  contra 0  leaf 95 eqs / 92 vars  (excess +3)
  W=12  229.7s  r2=42  contra 0  leaf 111 / 101         (excess +10)
  W=11  268.6s  r2=43  contra 0  leaf 126 / 108         (excess +18)
  W=10  296.4s  r2=43  contra 0  -- output JSON LOST to a disk-full crash
                                    (ENOSPC in json.dump); stats survive here only.
SEPARATELY AND MORE IMPORTANTLY: these runs were futile in any case.  The
truncations at W >= 12 are certifiably NON-EMPTY (an explicit rational witness
in the repo satisfies all their equations and side conditions), so no
contradiction could ever have been found.  See CATCHES.md "P0 IS FUTILE".
